<title>CHINA: China Jan-April crude oil imports up 44.4 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-April crude oil imports up 44.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 9.91 million tonnes of crude oil in January-April 1997, a rise of 44.4 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China imported 2.62 million tonnes of crude oil in April alone, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's exports of crude oil reached 6.3 million tonnes in the first four months, up 21 percent from the year-ago period, they showed.</p>
<p>China exported 2.56 million tonnes of crude oil in April alone, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
